CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'clen == PAGE_SIZE'
#754: FILE: drivers/block/zram/zram_drv.c:480:
+	if ((clen == PAGE_SIZE) && !is_partial_io(bvec)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

